        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The thunderbird spreads their wings and blasts their foe with thunderous bolts of lightning. Each creature in a 30ft Emanation takes 6d6 Electricity Damage|options:area-damage]{6d6 electricity damage and 6d6 sonic damage} (Basic DC 30 Reflex Saving Throw save). The thunderbird can't use Lightning Blast for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
